msgstr ""
"# Maintainers\n"
"\n"
"This document lists the maintainers of this project.\n"
"\n"
"## Maintainers\n"
"\n"
"- [Name 1](https://github.com/username1) - Role/Responsibility\n"
"- [Name 2](https://github.com/username2) - Role/Responsibility\n"
"\n"
"## Responsibilities\n"
"\n"
"- Review and merge pull requests\n"
"- Respond to issues and feature requests\n"
"- Maintain project documentation\n"
"- Ensure code quality and test coverage\n"
"- Manage releases and versioning\n"
"\n"
"## Becoming a Maintainer\n"
"\n"
"To become a maintainer, you must:\n"
"\n"
"1. Demonstrate consistent contributions to the project\n"
"2. Show a deep understanding of the codebase\n"
"3. Be active in the community and responsive to feedback\n"
"4. Receive approval from existing maintainers\n"
"\n"
"## Current Maintainers\n"
"\n"
"- [Name 1](https://github.com/username1) - Lead Maintainer\n"
"- [Name 2](https://github.com/username2) - Maintainer\n"
"\n"
"## Emeritus Maintainers\n"
"\n"
"- [Name 3](https://github.com/username3) - Emeritus Maintainer\n"

